  "kind": "death",
  "title": "A Tribute to Coach Chuck Amato",
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Chuck Amato has passed away at 80, leaving a legacy of leadership and dedication.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "Chuck Amato",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "In Easton, Pennsylvania, he first found his strength as a high school wrestler.",
      "shot": "photo:2",
      "card": {
        "big": "Easton, Pennsylvania",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Moving to North Carolina State University, he played linebacker and captained the defense.",
      "shot": "photo:1",
      "card": {
        "big": "NC State Linebacker",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Then came his return to NC State as head coach in the year 2000.",
      "shot": "photo:1",
      "card": {
        "big": "Head Coach, 2000",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "That tenure saw the Wolfpack reach the 2003 Gator Bowl and finish ranked 12th in the AP Poll.",
      "shot": "photo:1",
      "card": {
        "big": "2003 Gator Bowl",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Spending 18 seasons at Florida State, he coached the defensive line and linebackers.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "Florida State Coach",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "His long career finished at Akron, retiring in 2018 after 45 years in coaching.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "Retired, 2018",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "A man of discipline, he even earned a master's degree in education.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "Master's Degree, 1973",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Chuck Amato will be remembered for his steady hand and a lifetime of service to the game.",
      "shot": "photo:0",
      "card": {
        "big": "A Lifetime of Service",
        "small": ""
      },
      "pause_after": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow Orbitwire for the stories the whole world is talking about.",
      "shot": "outro",
      "card": {
        "big": "Orbitwire",
        "small": "Sources in the description"
      },
      "pause_after": 0.5
    }
  ],
